en by\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{-\\sqrt{3}}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x=-\\sqrt{3}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x=-\\sqrt{3}\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533433 17592186045585 true] [17592186360623 1068 #edb/ref 17592186360078 13194139533433 17592186045585 true] [17592186360623 1069 "q-95651" 13194139533433 17592186045585 true] [17592186360623 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533433 17592186045585 true] [17592186360623 1071 "$$\n\n$\\int \\frac{3}{{e}^{2}\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" 13194139533433 17592186045585 true] [17592186360623 1072 #uuid "845b26d8-3257-53fb-bd4c-3e05a2654c1a" 13194139533433 17592186045585 true] [17592186360623 1074 "The derivative of the inverse hyperbolic cosine function is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{{e}^{2}\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{3}{{e}^{2}}\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\,\\text{d}x=\\frac{3}{{e}^{2}}\\operatorname{arcosh}⁡x+C.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533433 17592186045585 true] [17592186360624 1068 #edb/ref 17592186360362 13194139533433 17592186045585 true] [17592186360624 1069 "q-95652" 13194139533433 17592186045585 true] [17592186360624 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533433 17592186045585 true] [17592186360624 1071 "$$\n\nCalculate $\\int \\frac{1-{e}^{2}}{1-{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x$  for $|x|<1.$" 13194139533433 17592186045585 true] [17592186360624 1072 #uuid "6656e58d-9cf2-58cb-8d69-d187b6e20227" 13194139533433 17592186045585 true] [17592186360624 1074 "The derivative of the inverse hyperbolic tangent function is given by\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{artanh}⁡x)=\\frac{1}{1-{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{1-{e}^{2}}{1-{x}^{2}}\\,\\